WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.582
Hey, it's a giant pink bird!

2
00:00:08.583 --> 00:00:12.987
Who are you?

3
00:00:12.988 --> 00:00:16.759
I'm a flamingo.

4
00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:20.833
Flamingos are waders.

5
00:00:20.834 --> 00:00:26.538
Those are birds that stay near shallow water.

6
00:00:26.539 --> 00:00:29.361
Where do you live?

7
00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:34.247
We live all over the world.

8
00:00:34.248 --> 00:00:40.071
We like lakes, ponds, and oceans.

9
00:00:40.072 --> 00:00:43.187
Do you live alone?

10
00:00:43.188 --> 00:00:46.308
Nope.

11
00:00:46.309 --> 00:00:53.559
Flamingos live together in big groups.

12
00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:59.630
Wow! You can stand on one leg!

13
00:00:59.631 --> 00:01:04.736
Yes, we stand on one leg to rest.

14
00:01:04.737 --> 00:01:09.321
And we stand on two legs to eat.

15
00:01:09.322 --> 00:01:13.388
What do you eat?

16
00:01:13.389 --> 00:01:18.692
We like snails, plants, and fish.

17
00:01:18.693 --> 00:01:31.412
We also eat lots of shrimp.

18
00:01:31.413 --> 00:01:36.904
Their pink color makes our feathers turn pink!

19
00:01:36.905 --> 00:01:41.036
Your neck is so long!

20
00:01:41.037 --> 00:01:45.280
Our long neck helps us to fish.

21
00:01:45.281 --> 00:01:49.498
And our bill is like a shovel.

22
00:01:49.499 --> 00:01:54.022
We use it to scoop up food.

23
00:01:54.023 --> 00:01:56.363
Can you swim?

24
00:01:56.364 --> 00:01:59.319
Oh yes, we can swim.

25
00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:05.104
We have webbed feet.

26
00:02:05.105 --> 00:02:09.696
We can also run on the water.

27
00:02:09.697 --> 00:02:17.221
And fly into the sky!

28
00:02:17.222 --> 00:02:24.066
Good-bye, Flamingo!

